#phone .cta>button[onclick^="hdChat"]{flex:0 0 auto!important;width:auto!important;padding:0 18px!important}
</style>
<style id="v832">/* v832: Marketplace listing page. "Make an offer" appeared twice and "Pay safely" repeated the Buy button in the bar. While the bar shows Buy, the safety card keeps its explanation and Set a meet-up, and the repeated buttons are hidden. */
